window.products.push({"id":1091194,"name":"Upgrade Stainless Steel Strainer Large Coffee French Press 34Oz with 4 Level Filter Screens, Built In Thicker Borosilicate Glass, Easy Clean & Using C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aqzRG0DnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕4 Level 304 grade stainless steel filtration system- the fine filters isolate the coffee ground and tea leaves better. And the thicker 304 grade stainless steel materials Prevent filter deformation, work better as well. ☕BPA FREE & FDA Certification:From product glass bottle and filtration systems to even filters that are safe and reliable.So you can enjoy your coffee to your heart's content ☕The Large coffee french presses made in thicker borosilicate glass- that making coffee french press more resistant to thermal shock than any other common glass french presses. borosilicate glass has the ability to go straight from a freezer to an oven rack without cracking. For you, this means you can pour boiling hot water into borosilicate glass if you wanted to say, steep tea or coffee, without worrying about shattering or cracking the glass. ☕Built in Removable Silicone base. The silicone base softer metal base, that can protect your coffee glass better than others french press. You do not worry about the glass beaker will be shaking any more after using the coffee french press with silicone base. ☕The 304 Grade stainless steel top of lid strainer-No any plastic flavor when you pour your coffee or tea by the stainless steel strainer. Give you a pure and perfect brewing with BPA-FREE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aqzRG0DnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonsenkitchen","source_asin":"B083JS3W2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083JS3W2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083JS3W2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1091195,"name":"The Matzah Baller (Matzah Ball Maker)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41anr1bLCJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cooking is all about preparation and presentation. The Matzah Baller saves you time and provides a uniform shape and size. Best of all, your hands stay clean. Matzah Balls are traditionally made in Jewish homes for special occasions like Passover or as a soothing addition to Chicken soup. For a hearty winter soup, try adding Matzah Balls to Butternut Squash soup, Vegetable soup, or Bean soup. Our Story Like many new products, The Matzah Baller was born from an idea. Traditionally, Matzah Balls are rolled by hand. Frustrated by sticky hands,the creator looked for an alternative for scooping the mix. Inspiration for The Matzah Baller came from a tool with a mesh ball. It allowed water to disperse and release the batter into the water. Expanding on the basic tool, the creator designed a product that is more durable, uses better quality stainless steel, and is more comfortable to squeeze. The Matzah Baller ... * Speeds up meal preparation * Is more sanitary * Delivers a consistent product Recipe Included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41anr1bLCJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GC Becker Products","source_asin":"B0060NJA7A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0060NJA7A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0060NJA7A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
