window.products.push({"id":1091231,"name":"Home Styles Country Casual Compact Office Cabinet, Distressed Oak Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YcTRbR-lL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The country casual compact office cabinet is a logical addition to the home that needs an office work area but doesn't have the space. The cabinet is made from ash hardwood solid and oak veneer with a multi-step oak finish including a clear coat finish to help protect against wear and tear stemming from normal use. As the name, country casual, suggests, this collection features both hand applied, physical and finish distressed design elements that provide an authentic aged or rustic look. Features include file drawer that accommodates letter or legal size files, drawer measures 21-1/4-inch width 18-1/2-inch depth by 10-inch height, keyboard with ball bearing drawer guides that fully extend, keyboard measures 32-inch width by 15-inch depth by 1-3/4-inch height, accommodates printer shelf measures 23-1/4-inch width by 20-3/4 depth by 8-1/4-inch height, CPU compartment measures 9-3/4-inch width by 21-inch depth by 18-1/2-inch height, small storage drawer measures 7-3/4-inch width by 14-1/2-inch depth by 2-1/4-inch height, open below the small drawer includes a small adjustable shelf and doors fit flush against unit. Easy to assemble. The compact office cabinet measures 38-1/2-inch width by 23-3/4-inch depth by 32-inch height.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YcTRbR-lL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Styles","source_asin":"B002KI0NDO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002KI0NDO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002KI0NDO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1091232,"name":"Ear Piercing Pillow for Side Sleepers | Ear Pillow with Donut Hole for CNH, Tinnitus or Ear Pain Relief | Adjustable Firmness for Ultimate Support and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NQirdoX1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finally, an ear tastic treat for a good night’s sleep! The Moli Pillow is your new bedtime companion that brings comfort , support and care to your ear while sleeping. Made with 100% polyester filling and 100% cotton pillowcase, this ear pillow is designed specifically for side sleepers, for someone who likes to put their earphones or earplugs on while sleeping, who has earrings or new piercings, and for someone with ear conditions such as CNH, tinnitus, or pressure sores. This side sleeper pillow is perfect for ear pain relief and recovery. This ear pillow with hole is FIRM by design . Remove ( or add more ) filling to adjust its height and softness depending on your comfort. Its side panel feature allows it to hold its shape and give side sleepers the best support while sleeping, with airflow and cooling perfectly coming through the hole. The ear hole is 4 inches in diameter. It is 4 inches from one side and 5 inches from the other side, allowing you to choose which side works best for you. Its pillowcase encapsulates the sides of the hole to ensure your sore ear won’t rub against the hole opening. Its distinctive midnight blue zipper runs around the side of the case giving the pillow a sleek and tailored look. How To Use: Remove the pillow by tearing the polybag. Remove the pillow by tearing the polybag. Fluff lightly with hand and let it sit in for a few hours. Fluff lightly with hand and let it sit in for a few hours. Wait until the pillow takes on its original form and firmness. Wait until the pillow takes on its original form and firmness. You may iron the pillowcase to remove the wrinkles caused by vacuum packaging. You may iron the pillowcase to remove the wrinkles caused by vacuum packaging. Adjust the Height and Firmness, Just the Way You Like It Remove the pillowcase. Remove the pillowcase. Unzip the inner case of the pillow. Unzip the inner case of the pillow. Remove or add filling (not included) to adjust to your preferred height and firmness. Remove or add filling (not included) to adjust to your preferred height and firmness. For your ears’ comfort, support, and care, get the Moli Pillow and ear-sperience a perfect sleep! Tip : The Moli Pillow comes beautifully packaged and makes for a thoughtful gift to family or friends who can benefit from its functional and intentional design. Give your loved ones the gift of a relaxing sleep today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NQirdoX1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moli Pillow","source_asin":"B0BK737JTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK737JTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK737JTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
