window.products.push({"id":1091342,"name":"Extra Large Cooking Stainless Steel Kitchen Utensil Organizer Modern Hollow Design Cylindrical Holder Kitchen Caddy for Countertop (Doesn't Included U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519w3Ng8zMS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Utensil holder has the drain hole design on the base makes it easy for water to flow through. Kitchen utensil holder is made of stainless steel with polished process. Stainless steel cylinder is rust, durable and sturdy. Oversized utensil holder adopts a hollow design which is ventilated and breathable. Utensil holder has spacious design so that you can conveniently put your utensils in kitchenware holder. Cookware holder simply wipe down with a damp cloth to clean. Stainless steel cylinder is very practical for cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519w3Ng8zMS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WECANDS","source_asin":"B08TBT7JHV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TBT7JHV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TBT7JHV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1091343,"name":"TwentyNext Fireplace Grate 20 Inch Heavy Duty Solid Steel Fire Grate Wood Log Rack Stove Firewood Holder for Indoor Hearth Outdoor Fire Pit Chimney He","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YSf0Y385L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy Duty Grate: The fireplace log grate measures 20'' L x 11.5'' W x 6.8'' H, 0.75-inch solid thick square bar steel, the weight is 11 Lbs. The high quality thick steel structure fire place log holder rack can be used for a long time. The unique design of the straight legs and added a support leg in the middle, not only keep firewood from falling & provide extra support, but reduce its deformation that caused by long-term combustion. Superior Circulation: The wood rack leg is 4\" high, this gives enough elevation for the wood and easy air circulation and easy heating, the air to can be better circulate. Longer lasting fire for better warming while minimizing smoke, convenient for ashes cleaning. No Assembly Required: No need to assemble, the heavy duty fire place log grate is small sturdy, heavy duty fire place log grate suitable for both indoor decorative wood burning fire places and outdoor durable fire pit grate. Compact Design: Space-saving structure makes the fireplace grate a perfect fit for any indoor fireplace or outdoor fire pit. You can take it to anywhere you want. Multi-purposes: This sturdy, heavy duty fire place log grate suitable for both indoor decorative wood burning fire places and outdoor durable fire pit grate. It is convenient to bring it to backyards, patios, deck, mantel fireplace, chimney or anywhere a wood burning fireplace is needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YSf0Y385L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TwentyNext","source_asin":"B0BD4HB77B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD4HB77B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD4HB77B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1091344,"name":"Lolita from Enesco Wine Glass, Love You Mom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jNaFISQIL._AC_.jpg","description":"The love you mom wine glass from Lolita's \"Love My Wine\" collection is distinctively painted to reflect its title and also includes a unique wine cooler recipe on the bottom of the stem. Every wine glass contains a different recipe and theme. Original Tracy Lolita Yancey designs on a generous 15-oz wine glass make a great gift for anyone, wine lover or not. This popular new shape for wine glasses is appropriate for either red or white wine. Its oversized 15-oz bowl allows ample space for wine to breathe, allowing the full potential of your cabernet, shiraz, merlot, chardonnay, Riesling or zinfandel to unfold. Don't like wine? Fill 'er up with your favorite juice or cocktail, even candy if you so choose. The individuality of each glass's theme makes them suitable for whomever comes to mind when you see them. The beautifully packaged, distinctively decorated, round and reusable gift box almost make this purchase two gifts in one. To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. The one and only Lolita, who took hold of her original idea for a fancier martini glass and expanded it to fit absolutely any person and then took the world by storm in 2004 to become the hottest gift brand in the U.S. Now, after many successful products, designs and collections, she continues to stand behind what she has always believed.that life should be lived to its fullest and every moment should be celebrated. Lolita is THE original source for unique glassware designs. What is your moment? Commemorate it with a wine, margarita or martini glass, a shooter, rocks glass or pilsner. For whichever of life's big moments, there is a Lolita style to fit it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jNaFISQIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B00B84S86U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B84S86U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B84S86U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
