window.products.push({"id":1091368,"name":"100% Natural Jumbo Coconut Bowl Unique Gift Set. Eco-Friendly Vegan Organic Non-Toxic Reusable Sustainable Smoothie Açai Buddha Kitchen Bowl (Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pVNH5RJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% NATURAL ECO-FRIENDLY ORGANIC: sustainable, biodegradable, re-usable, up-cycled and vegan. Completely natural and free from chemicals and food safe. 100% plastic free and contains zero synthetic materials and are 100% free of parabens or plastics. LIGHTWEIGHT-DURABLE-EASY TO USE & CLEAN: Each bowl is hand polished by organic virgin coconut oil to maintain lasting finish & color. Clean with soap and water but should not be used in the microwave or dishwasher. Long lasting strong and durable material, resists water, and will not absorb stains or odors. Coconut bowls are fun to use and they will change the way you eat and enjoy your food. Everything looks & tastes better in a coconut. JUMBO SIZE WITH A MULTI-PURPOSE DESIGN: These jumbo coconut bowls are large and are the perfect size for your big bowls, salads, and main meals. Our coconut bowls can be used daily for snack, breakfast, smoothie, Buddha, and rice bowls. Also use them as home décor, accessories, and storage pieces in your home. Our unique dinnerware sets are perfect for dinner parties, picnics, and brunch or tropical themed events. HAND-CRAFTED ARTISAN PRODUCT: Every item is handmade in ethical conditions and harmony with nature. Handcrafted by local skilled and dedicated artisans in Vietnam by hand and using traditional methods. Bring nature indoors where you can get a taste of the tropics without leaving a carbon footprint straight to your kitchen. GIVE THE UNIQUE GIFT OF NATURE: Your coconut bowl and spoon set will be delivered in a beautifully designed recyclable/re-usable gift box and green packaging. Your friends and family can get creative with this unique gift. Coconut Bowls are a blank canvas, to turn your delicious meals into masterpieces. Clean eating and living has never looked and tasted so good.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pVNH5RJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hollis and Hanh","source_asin":"B08JMCTT48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JMCTT48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JMCTT48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
