window.products.push({"id":1091400,"name":"Space Heater with Thermostat, 1500W/750W 3s Fast Heating Space Heaters for Indoor Use, 3 Modes 75°Oscillating Safe and Quiet Buyounger Portable Heater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fx-t8SslL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【3 Speeds & 75° Oscillation】 Buyounger space heater offers two heat levels of 1500W or 750W and a cooling fan, 1500W (high temperature), 750W (low temperature) and 6W (natural wind) modes. You can switch between warm air and natural air freely to suit different needs in winter and summer. At the same time, the heater for indoor use can be rotated 75°. You can enjoy a wider constant temperature zone by turning the knob to the appropriate mode. 🔥【3S Instant and Stable Heating】The indoor portable electric heater has a powerful 1500W PTC ceramic heating element, which can quickly heat a small space in 3s in the cold winter, warming you and your family. I believe it will be the warmest gift for you and your family this winter. 🔥【Multi Protection Safety System】🔥The portable heater is made of flame retardant material with multiple safety protection design and has been certified by ETL. The structure of the electric heater is designed with multiple safety protections such as tip-over and overheating protection. When the indoor heater is accidentally knocked over or overheated, it will automatically shut down to avoid any fire hazard. Small space heaters are great for families with kids and pets. 🔥【Quiet Desk Heater】🔥The room heater works in a low noise environment, it does not exceed 40 dB, which is quiet enough to be used when sleeping in the bedroom. At the same time, the mini heater for desk can also heat the space without interruption when you study, read, work and watch movies ect. (Please place the electric heater on a flat ground or desktop, and do not cover the room heater or block the air inlet.) 🔥【Compact and Portable】The portable heaters for indoor use measures 11 x 5.9 x 5.9 inches, weighs 2.68 lbs, and the hidden handle design on the back is easy to carry, The desk heater with 4.5 feet lead cord and 2 prong connection suitable for office, room, desk, home, bedroom, and also the best gift for family and friends in winter. 🔥【24H Worry-free After-sales Service】🔥🔥Buyounger has always been committed to providing customers with top products and good after-sales service. The space heater has undergone a lot of testing and strict quality inspection before market sales. If you encounter any problems during use, you can contact us through \"Contact Sellers\" button, and we will provide a dedicated 24-hour round-the-clock service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fx-t8SslL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buyounger","source_asin":"B0BCYJZ9JM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCYJZ9JM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCYJZ9JM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
