window.products.push({"id":1091465,"name":"Wooden Utensil Set - Kitchen Cute - Supplies & Utensils Set of 5 made of Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Pe7rOG2hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen utensils for all true cooking lovers !!! Our natural Utensil Set is made from solid Cherry wood that, with proper care, will last a lifetime for all your cooking or serving needs and withstand heat very well. Best kitchen utensil set: wood is the ideal material to use on any of your high quality and expensive cookware to ensure you will not scratch or damage them! Wooden kitchen utensils are artificially polished by our artisans, so the wood grain, color, weight, specifications may have a tiny difference, also, for this reason, every wooden product is a unique artwork.  These Kitchen Utensils are Natural & Eco-Friendly, with Food Safe Finish for added protection, lightweight and Comfortable Handle for stress-free cooking! Add a fun, stylish and unique look to your kitchen with this Cute Kitchen Utensils finish! Each product from this set features a convenient hanging hole in case you want to hang it from a rack or hook. Easy to clean, just use lukewarm water and soap, and self-dry!  Utensil Set includes:  ✔ Solid Spatula ✔ Slotted spatula ✔ Salad server fork ✔ Salad server spoon ✔ Cooking spoon  Care Instructions: Hand washing is the best way to clean any wooden kitchen implements. A dishwasher has too much heat and chlorine, and that causes premature cracking, splitting, and splintering. In case the wooden utensils darken in color over time, wipe them with rubbing alcohol to restore their original color.TO MAINTAIN THE UTENSILS IN PROPER CONDITION, RUB THEM WITH OLIVE OIL AFTER THE FIRST USE, AND CONTINUE TO DO SO EVERY 2 MONTHS","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Pe7rOG2hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyFancyCraft","source_asin":"B01NBW2WAA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NBW2WAA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NBW2WAA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
