window.products.push({"id":1091742,"name":"Under Sink Organizers and Storage, 2-Tier Bathroom Organizer Under Sink, Rustproof Storage Shelves with Sliding Storage Drawer, Carbon Steel Cabinet O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RWOSLlovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality: The under kitchen sink organizers are made of high-quality carbon steel, waterproof and rustproof, so the shelf is very sturdy, it's with a non-slip base at the cylinder bottom, making the shelf more stable, and has a strong bearing capacity, durable and long-lasting. Large Capacity & Widely Using: The size of this under sink organizers and storage is 14.06\"*10.24\"*16.34\". The 2-tier storage drawer design can meet your needs. It can be used to store cleaning items under the sink, snacks, and drinks in the living room, or kitchen countertop items. Sliding Drawer Storage Basket: This under the sink organizer adopts a storage drawer design that can along the track and slide freely. It slides smoothly, without jams, and effortlessly takes items. The grid visualization design helps you find things quickly and accurately. Don't overtighten the screws on the shelf during installation, or the drawer may be blocked from sliding. Foldable Design: The sliding storage basket of the shelf adopt the humanized foldable design. The drawer can be folded with a buckle, which is easy to use. If put the folded part away can help you expand the space. You can choose whether to fold or not according to your needs. Multipurpose: The under-sink organizer is not only can be used under the bathroom or kitchen cabinet, but also on the desktop as a kitchen spice rack for holding grains, canned food, and salt, as a basic storage shelf in your office and bedroom, as a bathroom tray to hold cosmetics, nail polish, towels, soap, shampoo, and so on. About the Material: There are many under-sink storage racks made of plastic. They are low cost. Many are made of recycled plastic. Although they are cheap, they are not durable and easy to damage. This product of ours is made of carbon steel metal, the material is thick and heavy, the outside is painted at high temperature, it will not rust, and it is durable, so the price will be higher than that of plastic products. Assembly Tips: When assembling, please don't rush to tighten the screws, just use your hands to simply tighten the screws, in the loose state, the screws can better align the holes, which can make the assembly easier, after the overall assembly is completed, you can use the included tool at this time, slowly tighten the screws, and finally you can get a very stable storage rack. About the drawer: If you feel that the drawer does not slide smoothly, you need to check whether the drawer is assembled correctly, and whether there are snaps at the bottom of the drawer to prevent sliding. If the drawer is installed correctly, then you need to check the shelf, loosen some screws properly, and the drawer slides more smoothly. About Return: Dear customer, if our products cannot meet your expectations and needs, we sincerely apologize to you, we will provide you with a free return service, when returning, please return all the items in the package, in this case, this product can be sold again, which is of great significance to a small business like ours, and at the same time can reduce waste of resources and protect the environment, thanks for your support. Service Guarantee: If for any reason, our under sink organizers and storage can't meet your needs, please contact us immediately. From refund to replacement, we will provide you with the right service. Don't wait any longer, enjoy it now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RWOSLlovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aouton","source_asin":"B09PMSVGJR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PMSVGJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PMSVGJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
