window.products.push({"id":1091866,"name":"French Rolling Pin for Baking with Pastry Mat - 15.75\" Stainless Steel with Tapered Design Great for Fondant, Pie Crust, Cookie, Pastry, Pasta, Pizza ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vj3IhEreL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-Stick and Sanitary This rolling pin is great for creating perfectly rolled dough because the steel is smooth and non-porous so the dough will not stick to the pin. Also, the stainless steel won't absorb odors, colors, or flavors and harbor bacteria or fungus like wood rolling pins can. The nonstick surface and preventing cross contamination makes for the best fondant, pie crust, cookie dough, pastries, pasta, and pizza dough. No Handles Design Our french rolling pin, unlike rollers with handles, has tactile feedback and lets you better sense the thickness of the dough as you're rolling and to adjust pressure as needed. The straight/rod style rolling pin gives you better control and requires less exertion and force. Roll cookies, pie, fondant, pasta, pizza, ravioli, tortillas, and dumplings with this premium rolling pin slightly tapered under your hands. Temperature Control To prevent the dough from warming too quickly, chill the metal rolling pin in the freezer. Stainless steel has the cooling properties of marble stone without the heaviness. You can alternatively warm the pin up in hot water if needed. Silicone Mat We have included with our stainless steel french rolling pin a silicone pastry dough mat to be used as a base for rolling dough and decorating pastries. It can withstand heat, so it is safe to use in the oven for baking. Dimensions and Properties The steel rolling pin is 16 inches long and 1.5 inches in diameter, weighing 10 ounces. It is made from 304 stainless steel, so it’s safe for food preparation and dining. So easy to clean and store; just wash it with warm water and soap for hassle free cleanup. Dough does not stick like plastic or wooden rolling pins. Also, it does not take up too much space in your kitchen drawer. Quality design will last many years, and will never crack or split like wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vj3IhEreL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AshTaKol","source_asin":"B07VK8P6P1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VK8P6P1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VK8P6P1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
