window.products.push({"id":1091910,"name":"Electric Heated Mattress Pad King Size 78\"x80\", Underblanket Mattress Cover Bed Fit up to 15\" Deep Pocket, Dual Digital Control with 10 Heating Levels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uGMhAm9dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coral Velvet Efficient Heating - Small heating wires are wrapped and fixed in the soft blanket to provide users with ultimate comfort. The heating wires are placed evenly and densely to spread uniform and consistent heat through the whole body, warming you instantly. Our heating mattress excels others in enhanced thickness to bring added warmth all along. Put on your bedsheet in the usual manner so that the heated underblanket is between your mattress and the bedsheet. Large Size - Heated mattress pad underblanket is made of ultra-soft coral velvet, fine-textured and lint-free, with a soft feel to contact the skin harmoniously, free of irritation. Designed with gray, a color of elegance, to well match bedding of different colors, elevating lifestyle. Large enough (king size 77'' x 80'') to cover your double bed snugly. Easy Digital Control - After the heat reaches the desired temperature then transfer to the lower setting(1-5Levels) of the control to avoid overheating for a long time of continuous use. The electric mattress underblanket features dual removable controllers, to adjust 10 heating settings and 9 timer settings, which satisfies the individual needs of 2 users simultaneously to combat cold weather. Unique Design - The fabric side is designed with elasticity, which can fit up to a 15-inch deep pocket thick mattress and wrap your mattress in 360 degrees, suitable for most mattresses. If the heated mattress topper gets dirty, you can limit regular to spot cleaning or wash it in a washing machine for a thorough cleaning, improving health with easily maintained tidiness and softness. Machine washable, please separate the hand controller from the mattress pad before cleaning. ETL certification - Overheat protection and short-circuit protection leave you peace of mind. The electric mattress pad possesses ETL certification, with 10 hr auto shut off and overheating protection to provide added safety and conserve energy, so there is no need to worry about forgetting to turn off the power, and easy to operate allowing all family members can use it at ease while allowing you to sleep warmly on winter nights.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uGMhAm9dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHRUN","source_asin":"B0B3RHWW8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1091910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3RHWW8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3RHWW8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
